        527.398193359375,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "is provided in an equitable fashion without placing marginalized and vulnerable populations at an",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.4338989257812,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "added disadvantage; it focuses on the human rights aspects of screening so that there are appropriate",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.966399192810059,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.4212646484375,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "safeguards in law, policy and practice to minimize any additional stigma, discrimination, violation of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.4441528320312,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "bodily integrity or restrictions on freedom of movement; and people who are offered testing and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.1721801757812,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "treatment should understand the associated uncertainties, which will help them make decisions about",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.976274490356445,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        527.4102172851562,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "care options. Established human rights principles, such as consent, noncoercion, and confidentiality,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.59071350097656,
        166.4952850341797,
        161.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "should be respected.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        175.02191162109375,
        509.0973815917969,
        199.81690979003906
      ],
      "text": "2.1 Systematic screening for TB disease among the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        197.8218994140625,
        238.88690185546875,
        222.6168975830078
      ],
      "text": "general population",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.57869720458984,
        236.5888214111328,
        500.7799072265625,
        251.0318145751953
      ],
      "text": "1. Systematic screening for TB disease may be conducted among the general population in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.57869720458984,
        248.5888214111328,
        341.55816650390625,
        263.0318298339844
      ],
      "text": "areas with an estimated TB prevalence of 0.5% or higher",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.57869720458984,
        262.04681396484375,
        457.75408935546875,
        279.2838439941406
      ],
      "text": "updated recommendation: conditional recommendation, low certainty of evidence ( ).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        306.7585144042969,
        353.07244873046875,
        325.0285339355469
      ],
      "text": "2.1.1 Summary of the evidence and rationale",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        331.7344970703125,
        527.400634765625,
        346.1775207519531
      ],
      "text": "Systematic screening in the general population is conducted on the premise that it bears dual benefit:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.980281829833984,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        344.93450927734375,
        527.5416259765625,
        359.3775329589844
      ],
      "text": "to the persons diagnosed with TB and to the community in which screening is conducted. Individuals",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.996549606323242,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        358.1344909667969,
        527.4254150390625,
        372.5775146484375
      ],
      "text": "found to have TB may benefit from less diagnostic delay, improved treatment outcomes, and lower",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        371.3345031738281,
        527.4343872070312,
        385.77752685546875
      ],
      "text": "costs and financial losses associated with the disease. It also benefits public health by reducing the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        384.5345153808594,
        409.27130126953125,
        398.9775390625
      ],
      "text": "population prevalence of TB, thereby reducing further transmission of TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        406.2384033203125,
        527.4375,
        420.6814270019531
      ],
      "text": "There is limited direct evidence of individual benefit from improved treatment success or reduced",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        419.43841552734375,
        527.4387817382812,
        433.8814392089844
      ],
      "text": "mortality when TB screening is performed in the general population. There is some evidence that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        432.6383972167969,
        527.2120361328125,
        447.0814208984375
      ],
      "text": "systematic screening helps reduce delay in TB diagnosis and that it detects patients at an earlier",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        445.8384094238281,
        527.3851318359375,
        460.28143310546875
      ],
      "text": "stage of their disease. Data also show that screening interventions result in a reduction in costs for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        459.03839111328125,
        527.5916137695312,
        473.4814147949219
      ],
      "text": "patients who are detected through screening and, most critically, a reduction in the risk of catastrophic",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.971814155578613,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        472.2384033203125,
        527.4451904296875,
        486.6814270019531
      ],
      "text": "costs for patients detected through screening and their families. However, some data show that the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        485.43841552734375,
        527.4747924804688,
        499.8814392089844
      ],
      "text": "proportion of people who do not start treatment is higher among those identified through screening",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.993047714233398,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        498.6383972167969,
        271.91754150390625,
        513.0814208984375
      ],
      "text": "than among those who present with illness.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        520.34228515625,
        527.5576171875,
        534.7852783203125
      ],
      "text": "With respect to the benefits of screening for the community, there is inconsistent evidence that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        533.5424194335938,
        527.2098388671875,
        547.9854125976562
      ],
      "text": "systematic screening for TB improves detection and notification in the general population, with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        546.7423095703125,
        527.38037109375,
        561.185302734375
      ],
      "text": "none coming from randomized trials. There is, however, evidence of an effect on TB prevalence and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        559.9422607421875,
        527.4398803710938,
        574.38525390625
      ],
      "text": "transmission. A trial in Viet Nam in a population with an estimated prevalence of 0.35% that used 3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        573.142333984375,
        527.4345092773438,
        587.5853271484375
      ],
      "text": "years of annual door-to-door sputum collection and testing using the Xpert MTB/RIF assay showed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        583.5482788085938,
        527.4039306640625,
        600.7852783203125
      ],
      "text": "(13) that systematic screening reduced adult TB disease prevalence  . An observational study in China",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        599.5424194335938,
        527.4276733398438,
        613.9854125976562
      ],
      "text": "conducted between 2013 and 2015 reported that three rounds of door-to-door symptom screening",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        612.742431640625,
        527.3859252929688,
        627.1854248046875
      ],
      "text": "followed by CXR were associated with serial reductions in the absolute number of people with TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        623.1483764648438,
        527.605224609375,
        640.3853759765625
      ],
      "text": "(14) detected . In addition, two trials showed lower frequencies of TB infection among children in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        636.3483276367188,
        498.02197265625,
        653.5853271484375
      ],
      "text": "(13, 15) clusters where TB screening was done compared with others without the intervention  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        660.8463134765625,
        527.4266967773438,
        675.289306640625
      ],
      "text": "This is an updated recommendation: previously, systematic screening for TB disease in the general",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        674.0463256835938,
        527.4003295898438,
        688.4893188476562
      ],
      "text": "population was recommended in defined populations with extremely high levels of undetected TB,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        687.246337890625,
        527.631103515625,
        701.6893310546875
      ],
      "text": "defined as a 1% prevalence or higher. Based on the updated evidence reviewed, the GDG concluded",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.99804973602295,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        700.4462890625,
        527.3946533203125,
        714.8892822265625
      ],
      "text": "that the threshold of 1% recommended in the 2013 guidelines could be lowered, but considered",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        713.6463012695312,
        527.402587890625,
        728.0892944335938
      ],
      "text": "that screening under programmatic conditions would not perform as well as was observed in the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        726.8463134765625,
        527.4078979492188,
        741.289306640625
      ],
      "text": "trial in Viet Nam and, therefore, proposed a 0.5% threshold to guide country implementation. Thus,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        740.0463256835938,
        527.1922607421875,
        754.4893188476562
      ],
      "text": "the GDG recommended that general population screening may be considered in defined areas",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        753.1363525390625,
        527.4364013671875,
        767.6893310546875
      ],
      "text": "Web Annex B Web  with a prevalence of undetected TB of 0.5% or more (see  , Tables 1 and 2, and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        766.3363037109375,
        158.24790954589844,
        780.8892822265625
      ],
      "text": "Annex C , Table 1).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
